 x:text-gray-600 x:hover:text-gray-900 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:dark:hover:text-gray-300 x:contrast-more:text-gray-900 x:contrast-more:underline x:contrast-more:dark:text-gray-50 x:break-words">Quick start</a></li><li class="x:my-2 x:scroll-my-6 x:scroll-py-6"><a href="#1-generate-a-keyring" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:ms-3 x:block x:transition-colors x:subpixel-antialiased x:text-gray-600 x:hover:text-gray-900 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:dark:hover:text-gray-300 x:contrast-more:text-gray-900 x:contrast-more:underline x:contrast-more:dark:text-gray-50 x:break-words">1. Generate a keyring</a></li><li class="x:my-2 x:scroll-my-6 x:scroll-py-6"><a href="#2-produce-a-pay-address" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:ms-3 x:block x:transition-colors x:subpixel-antialiased x:text-gray-600 x:hover:text-gray-900 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:dark:hover:text-gray-300 x:contrast-more:text-gray-900 x:contrast-more:underline x:contrast-more:dark:text-gray-50 x:break-words">2. Produce a Pay Address</a></li><li class="x:my-2 x:scroll-my-6 x:scroll-py-6"><a href="#3-validate-a-received-pay-address" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:ms-3 x:block x:transition-colors x:subpixel-antialiased x:text-gray-600 x:hover:text-gray-900 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:dark:hover:text-gray-300 x:contrast-more:text-gray-900 x:contrast-more:underline x:contrast-more:dark:text-gray-50 x:break-words">3. Validate a received Pay Address</a></li><li class="x:my-2 x:scroll-my-6 x:scroll-py-6"><a href="#4-persist-and-restore-a-keyring" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:ms-3 x:block x:transition-colors x:subpixel-antialiased x:text-gray-600 x:hover:text-gray-900 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:dark:hover:text-gray-300 x:contrast-more:text-gray-900 x:contrast-more:underline x:contrast-more:dark:text-gray-50 x:break-words">4. Persist and restore a keyring</a></li><li class="x:my-2 x:scroll-my-6 x:scroll-py-6"><a href="#next-steps" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:font-semibold x:block x:transition-colors x:subpixe