<h3 id="2-produce-a-pay-address" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-8 x:text-2xl">2. Produce a Pay Address<a href="#2-produce-a-pay-address" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h3>
